# Test cases («Тест-кейсы»), before Разработка
File id only: `playbook-step-04-test-cases.mdc`.

Derive every case from the feature Given/When/Then and from the architecture API and error paths. Cover every criterion. Mark which cases become automated. A gap goes to «Решения»; do not close it in silence.

- Epic: no «Тест-кейсы» section. Owner epic acceptance uses the chosen user story and the problem in «Бизнес-анализ» (`playbook-step-07-acceptance.mdc`). An older epic page that already has «Тест-кейсы» stays as it is; that section is not a screen specification and not another task type.
- Feature column Тест-кейсы, including a bug-feature: id (`ТК-1`), precondition, steps, expected result, level (unit / integration / e2e / ручная на dev). Разработка starts only after Аналитика, Архитектура, and Тест-кейсы are on this page, and no «Решения» row for this slice has an empty «Выбрано».
- A typo fix inside an open feature does not add a new test-case section. Extend the open feature's cases when the fix needs a regression check.
